  "note": "The primary header's two-character country code (Table 10a field 6), and the first part of a WOD cruise identifier (p.17). 99 means unknown. Mostly ISO 3166-1 alpha-2, plus WOD's own: DU East Germany, SU Soviet Union, YU Yugoslavia, EU European Union, ZZ miscellaneous organization.",
